@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = PEGAR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Login: usar SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@nexus.gg","password":"ChangeThisBeforeUse2026!"}

### Resumen
GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Equipos
GET {{base}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Organización
GET {{base}}/organization
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear evento
POST {{base}}/calendar/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Scrim de prueba","team":"Valorant","date":"2026-10-10","time":"18:00","type":"Entrenamiento"}

### Tareas pendientes
GET {{base}}/tasks?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear tarea
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Preparar VOD","team":"Valorant","who":"Nico","due":"2026-10-10","priority":true,"done":false}

### Cerrar sesión
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
